---
import Logo from './Logo.astro';
import { SITE, FREE_ROUTE, PAYMENT_LINE, FOOTER_LINKS, FIGURES } from '../data/site';
const c = SITE.company;
---
<footer class="ftr">
  <div class="wrap ftr-in">
    <div class="ftr-top">
      <div><Logo mark="#04C78D" /></div>
      <nav class="ftr-nav" aria-label="Footer">
        {FOOTER_LINKS.map((l) => <a href={l.href}>{l.label}</a>)}
      </nav>
    </div>
    <div class="ftr-legal">
      <p>{SITE.name} is a trading style of {c.legalName}, registered in {c.jurisdiction}, Company registration number {c.number}. Registered Office: {c.address.street}, {c.address.locality}, {c.address.postcode}. Authorised and regulated by the Financial Conduct Authority for Claims Management activities ({c.frn}). Registered with the Information Commissioner’s Office; registration number {c.icoRef}. You can find our <a href="/terms-of-service/">terms of use</a>, <a href="/privacy-policy/">privacy policy</a> and our <a href="/cookies/">cookie policy</a> here. {c.legalName} is a claims management company.</p>
      <p>Where No Win, No Fee is offered – You pay nothing unless your claim is successful. A fee between 18 – 36%, including VAT applies on successful claims (fee dependent on level of redress secured), and a cancellation fee may apply outside the 14 day cooling-off period. {PAYMENT_LINE}</p>
      <p>{FREE_ROUTE}</p>
      <p>***All figures disclosed on the results page of our form are based on the FCA’s projected average payout of {FIGURES.average} per eligible agreement</p>
      <p>© Claim Simple Limited {new Date().getFullYear()}</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</footer>
